<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάλᾰρον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[φᾰ]</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάλος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boss</i> or <i>disc,</i> mostly in pl., once
			in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλετο δ᾽ αἰεὶ κὰπ φάλαρ᾽
				εὐποίηθ᾽,</span> of metal <i>bosses</i> on a helmet,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.106
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλείου τιάρας φάλαρον πιφαύσκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					662
				</span></i>
			(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,
				<i>cheek-pieces</i> of a horse's head-stall (expld. by 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραγναθίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν γνάθων σκεπάσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				586
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.1.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.Euerg.
				9J.
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάλαρα</span> is a gloss in 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπυκτήρια φ. πώλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1069
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); cf. Lat. <i>phalerae.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bandages for the cheek,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fasc.</u>
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>ornaments,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.528a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				78.26
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
